---
const heroImage = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1635650804060-bb009bcb2ea5?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop';
---

<section class="section relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="bzk-halftone pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container-blazek relative grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="animate-rise-in flex flex-col gap-6">
      <span class="bzk-stamp w-fit text-secondary">BZK · Buenos Aires</span>
      <h1 class="text-hero">
        El cambio es<br />
        <span class="bzk-gradient-text">lo único seguro</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body-alt max-w-md text-lg text-muted-foreground">
        Indumentaria para la edad en la que todo se mueve. No vendemos ropa: armamos un lugar
        donde encontrarte.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="#quiz" class="inline-flex h-14 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-8 font-display text-base uppercase tracking-wide text-primary-foreground transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          Encontrá tu prenda
        </a>
        <a href="#waitlist" class="inline-flex h-14 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border-2 border-foreground px-8 font-display text-base uppercase tracking-wide text-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-foreground hover:text-background">
          Anotate a la waitlist
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="animate-rise-in relative mx-auto w-full max-w-md">
      <div class="bzk-oval-frame">
        <img src={heroImage} alt="Comunidad streetwear BLAZEK" loading="eager" decoding="async" width="600" height="432" />
      </div>
      <span class="bzk-stamp absolute -bottom-3 left-6 bg-accent text-accent-foreground">Prelaunch 2026</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
